<title>USA: PCX adds Gemstar, Paul Harris, Staffmark options.</title>
<headline>PCX adds Gemstar, Paul Harris, Staffmark options.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange said it would trade options on Gemstar International Group Ltd, Paul Harris Stores Inc and Staffmark Inc, beginning May 20.</p>
<p>Gemstar issues will be available for the months of June, July, August and November. The options have been allocated to lead market makers Ron Goodman and Mark Weinstock of Goodstock.</p>
<p>Paul Harris and Staffmark options will be available for the months of June, July, October and January. Sheldon Kahn of Headwaters Capital has been designated lead market maker on both options.</p>
<p>All three new issues will open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20.</p>
